# One line-ending policy for every text file: stored as LF, checked out as LF on every OS. The working tree had a mix
# of CRLF and LF files, so diffs showed whole files changed and editors kept flip-flopping the endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git must never try to normalise or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.pkl binary
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
*.parquet binary
